        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The command-line assistant now tags sign-in attempts with a unique, one-time label to help the Freebuff team track where users start the login process, and only applies this label to the free version of the product. This is an internal measurement change that does not affect how you use the assistant, sign in, or access features, and it does not change any visible behavior in daily use. The label and a related check on login progress are now recorded automatically so the team can see exactly where people get stuck in the sign-in flow, but nothing in your experience or settings changes because of this update.",
