        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff 0.2.30 introduces a new-user ad ramp that gradually introduces ads to new accounts and a dedicated CLI flow identifier to track sign-ins from the terminal. A new email sign-in option is now available across the desktop and CLI interfaces, expanding beyond previous account providers. The free model picker now includes MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast, while MiMo Fast is not part of this release's picker. Streak reward messaging has been simplified to a single short line, removing detailed status updates that previously cluttered the terminal display. Internal backend systems have moved into shadow mode for error tracking and integration data, allowing the team to validate a new database before fully switching over. The public SDK now restricts certain web requests to safer network addresses and stops including source code maps in its distributed package.",
